    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. I like the direction, but can you expand on the section about \"unreasonable disruption\"? Specifically, what kind of political expression should we explicitly label as \"disruptive\" or \"unacceptable\" to ensure we're protecting the inclusive environment you mentioned? I want to make sure we're clear on where the line is drawn.",
